<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK OCT CPI UP 0.7 PCT MO/MO, +5.3 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK OCT CPI UP 0.7 PCT MO/MO, +5.3 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak consumer prices rose</p>
<p>0.7 percent in October, putting prices 5.3 percent higher than</p>
<p>in October 1995, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK CONSUMER INFLATION   Oct '96   Sept '96     Oct '95</p>
<p>  pct change mo/mo		0.7	  0.9	    0.5</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		5.3	  5.2	    7.9</p>
<p>Details of Slovak September inflation:</p>
<p>				    Oct '96   Sept '96	Oct '95</p>
<p>Foodstuffs</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	0.9	  2.2	    0.4</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	  3.3	  2.8	    6.5</p>
<p>Non-food items</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	0.5	  0.4	    0.6</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	  6.5	  6.6	    8.2</p>
<p>Public catering</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	0.7	  0.6	    0.5</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	  5.7	  5.5	    9.0</p>
<p>Services</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	0.4	  0.6	    0.2</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	  5.1	  4.8	    8.5</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3688</p>
</text>
